## Usage

Optional for a single Plot or Facet. Use Scene with Row, Column, or Grid(columns=...) for dashboards. Its batch_update coordinates changes and its export methods compose the display. Svelte applications use normal markup/CSS for this layout.

<Note title="SVG and PDF export">

**Partly an image.** A Scene's SVG and PDF exports compose its Plots, Facets, Titles and Legends, each as its reference page says; a Markdown block and a 2D Minimap are images, and inputs and a Minimap of a 3D plot are left out. See [what is not exported as vector](/docs/export).

</Note>
